{"id": "314aa64f-f0e0-4f44-9318-f696b176f156", "slug": "aether-nexus-core-matrix", "title": "Aether Nexus - Core Matrix", "description": "Aether Nexus Testimonial Section is designed for showcasing social proof and customer credibility. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Aether Nexus - Core Matrix\"\ndescription: \"Aether Nexus Testimonial Section is designed for showcasing social proof and customer credibility. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#8B5CF6\"\n  secondary: \"#000000\"\n  accent: \"#F43F5E\"\n  background: \"#050505\"\n  surface: \"#E2E8F0\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Space Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Space Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"24px\"\n  control: \"24px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Aether Nexus - Core Matrix\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 3; favorites: 2; remixes: 0.\nTags: testimonial, section, animated, bento, social-proof.\n## Overview\nAether Nexus Testimonial Section is designed for showcasing social proof and customer credibility. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nSyncing clusters Initializing neural pathways across the Aether grid consult the databanks for logs Aether Nexus Initializing neural pathways on the Aether grid \"Colossus\" 128 Tesseract Cores 4,096 Quantum Threads 256 T…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Syncing clusters; Aether Nexus; \"Colossus\"; \"Spark\"; \"Maelstrom-Z\".\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #8B5CF6, secondary #000000, accent #F43F5E, background #050505, surface #E2E8F0, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Space Mono for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use Space Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Aether Nexus - Core Matrix</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=Space+Mono:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],\n                        mono: ['Space Mono', 'monospace'],\n                    },\n                    colors: {\n                        'core-violet': '#8B5CF6',\n                        'core-rose': '#F43F5E',\n                        'core-slate': '#E2E8F0',\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#050505] text-white font-sans overflow-x-hidden min-h-screen selection:bg-core-violet selection:text-white\" style=\"background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, #111 0%, #000 100%);\">\n\n    <!-- Main 3D Scene Container -->\n    <main class=\"relative w-full min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden\" style=\"perspective: 1200px;\">\n\n        <!-- Interactive Parallax Wrapper -->\n        <div id=\"scene\" class=\"relative w-full max-w-[1200px] h-[800px] flex items-center justify-center transform-style-3d\">\n\n            <!-- ================= CARD 1: ROSE (BACK LEFT) ================= -->\n            <div class=\"card-element absolute z-10 w-[320px] h-[500px] sm:w-[380px] sm:h-[580px] rounded-[24px] bg-core-rose flex flex-col justify-between p-6 sm:p-8 text-[#0a0a0a]\"\n                 style=\"touch-action: none; user-select: none; -webkit-user-select: none;\n                        transform: translateX(-35%) translateY(10%) translateZ(-150px) rotateZ(-8deg);\n                        box-shadow: inset 0 2px 4px rgba(255,255,255,0.2), inset 0 -3px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.3), inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.1), 0 20px 50px -10px rgba(0,0,0,0.9);\n                        background-image: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.06) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.08) 100%);\">\n\n                <!-- Skeuomorphic Details (Holes) -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#050505]/80\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute top-4 right-4 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#050505]/80\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-4 left-4 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#050505]/80\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-4 right-4 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#050505]/80\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute top-2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-[#050505]/80\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-[#050505]/80\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Content -->\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-4 relative z-10\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-mono text-[10px] sm:text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-transparent w-full\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);\">Syncing clusters</h4>\n                    <p class=\"font-mono text-[8px] sm:text-[9px] uppercase leading-tight max-w-[85%] opacity-70\">Initializing neural pathways across the Aether grid consult the databanks for logs</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center flex-grow gap-6 relative z-10\">\n                    <h1 class=\"masked-text font-sans font-normal text-4xl sm:text-5xl tracking-tighter text-[#0a0a0a]\">Aether Nexus</h1>\n                    <p class=\"font-mono text-[8px] sm:text-[9px] uppercase leading-tight max-w-[80%] opacity-70 text-center\">Initializing neural pathways<br>on the Aether grid</p>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-3 text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#0a0a0a]\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:slider-horizontal-linear\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <div class=\"w-8 h-8 sm:w-10 sm:h-10 border-2 border-[#0a0a0a] rounded flex items-center justify-center\">\n                             <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:record-circle-linear\" class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:play-linear\" class=\"rotate-[-90deg]\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-2\">\n                        <h3 class=\"masked-text font-mono text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide\">\"Colossus\"</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"font-mono text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] leading-relaxed opacity-80 mt-2\">\n                            <li>128 Tesseract Cores</li>\n                            <li>4,096 Quantum Threads</li>\n                            <li>256 TB Tachyon Cache</li>\n                            <li>600 TB Crystal Array</li>\n                            <li>25 kW thermal output</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 relative z-10\">\n                     <p class=\"font-mono text-[9px] sm:text-[10px] uppercase text-center leading-snug px-4 font-semibold\">Initialize a 5B weight<br>neural mesh over 16 nodes<br>using rapid commands</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- ================= CARD 2: SLATE (BACK RIGHT) ================= -->\n            <div class=\"card-element absolute z-20 w-[320px] h-[500px] sm:w-[380px] sm:h-[580px] rounded-[24px] bg-core-slate flex flex-col justify-between p-6 sm:p-8 text-[#111]\"\n                 style=\"touch-action: none; user-select: none; -webkit-user-select: none;\n                        transform: translateX(35%) translateY(15%) translateZ(-80px) rotateZ(10deg);\n                        box-shadow: inset 0 2px 5px rgba(255,255,255,1), inset 0 -3px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.1), inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05), 0 25px 60px -15px rgba(0,0,0,0.7);\n                        background-image: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.8) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.02) 100%);\">\n\n                <!-- Skeuomorphic Details (Holes) -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#050505]/70\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute top-4 right-4 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#050505]/70\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-4 left-4 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#050505]/70\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-4 right-4 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#050505]/70\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute top-2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-[#050505]/70\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-[#050505]/70\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Content -->\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-4 relative z-10\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-mono text-[10px] sm:text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-transparent w-full\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);\">Syncing clusters</h4>\n                    <p class=\"font-mono text-[8px] sm:text-[9px] uppercase leading-tight max-w-[85%] opacity-60\">Initializing neural pathways across the Aether grid consult the databanks for logs</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center flex-grow gap-6 relative z-10\">\n                    <h1 class=\"masked-text font-sans font-normal text-4xl sm:text-5xl tracking-tighter text-[#111]\">Aether Nexus</h1>\n                    <p class=\"font-mono text-[8px] sm:text-[9px] uppercase leading-tight max-w-[80%] opacity-60 text-center\">Initializing neural pathways<br>on the Aether grid</p>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-3 text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#111]\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:slider-horizontal-linear\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <div class=\"w-8 h-8 sm:w-10 sm:h-10 border-2 border-[#111] rounded flex items-center justify-center\">\n                             <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:record-circle-linear\" class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:play-linear\" class=\"rotate-[-90deg]\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-2\">\n                        <h3 class=\"masked-text font-mono text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide\">\"Spark\"</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"font-mono text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] leading-relaxed opacity-70 mt-2\">\n                            <li>64 Tesseract Cores</li>\n                            <li>2,048 Quantum Threads</li>\n                            <li>128 TB Tachyon Cache</li>\n                            <li>300 TB Crystal Array</li>\n                            <li>12 kW thermal output</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 relative z-10\">\n                     <p class=\"font-mono text-[9px] sm:text-[10px] uppercase text-center leading-snug px-4 font-semibold\">Initialize a 2B weight<br>neural mesh over 8 nodes<br>using rapid commands</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- ================= CARD 3: VIOLET (FRONT CENTER) ================= -->\n            <div class=\"card-element absolute z-30 w-[320px] h-[500px] sm:w-[380px] sm:h-[580px] rounded-[24px] bg-core-violet flex flex-col justify-between p-6 sm:p-8 text-[#0a0a0a]\"\n                 style=\"touch-action: none; user-select: none; -webkit-user-select: none;\n                        transform: translateY(-5%) translateZ(80px);\n                        box-shadow: inset 0 2px 5px rgba(255,255,255,0.3), inset 0 -4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.25), inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.15), 0 40px 80px -20px rgba(0,0,0,0.95), 0 0 40px rgba(139,92,246,0.15);\n                        background-image: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.1) 100%);\">\n\n                <!-- Skeuomorphic Details (Holes) -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#050505]/90\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.9), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.3);\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute top-4 right-4 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#050505]/90\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.9), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.3);\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-4 left-4 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#050505]/90\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.9), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.3);\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-4 right-4 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#050505]/90\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.9), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.3);\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute top-2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-[#050505]/90\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.9), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.3);\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-[#050505]/90\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.9), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.3);\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Content -->\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-4 relative z-10\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-mono text-[10px] sm:text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-transparent w-full\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\">Syncing clusters</h4>\n                    <p class=\"font-mono text-[8px] sm:text-[9px] uppercase leading-tight max-w-[85%] opacity-70\">Initializing neural pathways across the Aether grid consult the databanks for logs</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center flex-grow gap-6 relative z-10\">\n                    <h1 class=\"masked-text font-sans font-normal text-4xl sm:text-5xl tracking-tighter text-[#0a0a0a]\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\">Aether Nexus</h1>\n                    <p class=\"font-mono text-[8px] sm:text-[9px] uppercase leading-tight max-w-[80%] opacity-70 text-center\">Initializing neural pathways<br>on the Aether grid</p>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-3 text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#0a0a0a]\" style=\"filter: drop-shadow(0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.2));\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:slider-horizontal-linear\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <div class=\"w-8 h-8 sm:w-10 sm:h-10 border-2 border-[#0a0a0a] rounded flex items-center justify-center\">\n                             <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:record-circle-linear\" class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:play-linear\" class=\"rotate-[-90deg]\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-2\">\n                        <h3 class=\"masked-text font-mono text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide\">\"Maelstrom-Z\"</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"font-mono text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] leading-relaxed opacity-80 mt-2\">\n                            <li>256 Tesseract Cores</li>\n                            <li>8,192 Quantum Threads</li>\n                            <li>512 TB Tachyon Cache</li>\n                            <li>1.2 PB Crystal Array</li>\n                            <li>50 kW thermal output</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 relative z-10 w-full\">\n                     <p class=\"font-mono text-[9px] sm:text-[10px] uppercase text-center leading-snug px-4 font-semibold\">Initialize a 10B weight<br>neural mesh over 32 nodes<br>using rapid commands</p>\n\n                     <div class=\"flex items-end justify-between w-full mt-2 px-2\">\n                          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                              <!-- Hex Logo Skeuomorph -->\n                              <div class=\"w-6 h-6 border border-[#0a0a0a] flex items-center justify-center rounded-sm rotate-45\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.3);\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[5px] -rotate-45 font-semibold tracking-tighter\">ATHR</span></div>\n                              <p class=\"font-mono text-[6px] sm:text-[7px] max-w-[80px] leading-tight uppercase opacity-70\">Review our hardware topology in the archives</p>\n                          </div>\n                          <p class=\"font-mono text-[6px] sm:text-[7px] max-w-[110px] leading-tight opacity-70 text-right\">Enter the Nexus: the infrastructure driving hyper-reality<br>https://aether.net/grid</p>\n                     </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // WebGL-feel Parallax Effect\n            const scene = document.getElementById('scene');\n            const cards = document.querySelectorAll('.card-element');\n\n            document.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                const x = (e.clientX / window.innerWidth - 0.5) * 15;\n                const y = (e.clientY / window.innerHeight - 0.5) * -15;\n\n                gsap.to(scene, {\n                    rotationY: x,\n                    rotationX: y,\n                    duration: 1.5,\n                    ease: \"power2.out\"\n                });\n            });\n\n            // Initial 3D Entrance Animation\n            gsap.from(cards[0], { duration: 1.8, x: \"-80%\", y: \"40%\", z: -400, rotationZ: -20, opacity: 0, ease: \"expo.out\", delay: 0.2 });\n            gsap.from(cards[1], { duration: 1.8, x: \"80%\", y: \"40%\", z: -300, rotationZ: 30, opacity: 0, ease: \"expo.out\", delay: 0.4 });\n            gsap.from(cards[2], { duration: 2, z: 400, opacity: 0, ease: \"expo.out\", delay: 0.6 });\n\n            // Masked Staggered Word Reveal setup\n            const setupMaskedReveal = () => {\n                document.querySelectorAll('.masked-text').forEach(el => {\n                    const text = el.innerText;\n                    el.innerHTML = '';\n                    text.split(' ').forEach(word => {\n                        const wrapper = document.createElement('span');\n                        wrapper.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n                        wrapper.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                        wrapper.style.verticalAlign = 'top';\n                        if(word !== text.split(' ')[text.split(' ').length -1]) {\n                             wrapper.style.marginRight = '0.25em';\n                        }\n\n                        const inner = document.createElement('span');\n                        inner.innerText = word;\n                        inner.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                        inner.classList.add('reveal-inner');\n\n                        wrapper.appendChild(inner);\n                        el.appendChild(wrapper);\n                    });\n                });\n            };\n\n            setupMaskedReveal();\n\n            // Trigger Masked Reveal\n            setTimeout(() => {\n                gsap.utils.toArray('.masked-text').forEach(title => {\n                    gsap.from(title.querySelectorAll('.reveal-inner'), {\n                        y: \"110%\",\n                        duration: 0.8,\n                        stagger: 0.05,\n                        ease: \"power4.out\",\n                        delay: 1\n                    });\n                });\n            }, 100);\n\n            // --- DRAG TO CYCLE INTERACTION LOGIC ---\n\n            const cardStates = [\n                { x: \"-35%\", y: \"10%\", z: -150, rotationZ: -8, zIndex: 10 }, // 0: Back Left\n                { x: \"35%\",  y: \"15%\", z: -80,  rotationZ: 10, zIndex: 20 }, // 1: Back Right\n                { x: \"0%\",   y: \"-5%\", z: 80,   rotationZ: 0,  zIndex: 30 }  // 2: Front\n            ];\n\n            let activeIndices = [0, 1, 2]; // Maps physical DOM node index to state index\n            let isDragging = false;\n            let startX = 0, startY = 0;\n\n            // Set initial cursor for the front card\n            cards[2].style.cursor = 'grab';\n\n            cards.forEach((card, domIndex) => {\n                card.addEventListener('pointerdown', (e) => {\n                    const stateIdx = activeIndices[domIndex];\n                    if (stateIdx !== 2) return; // Only allow interacting with the front card\n\n                    isDragging = true;\n                    startX = e.clientX;\n                    startY = e.clientY;\n                    card.style.cursor = 'grabbing';\n\n                    gsap.killTweensOf(card); // Stop any ongoing reset animations\n                });\n            });\n\n            document.addEventListener('pointermove', (e) => {\n                if (!isDragging) return;\n\n                const deltaX = e.clientX - startX;\n                const deltaY = e.clientY - startY;\n\n                const frontIndex = activeIndices.indexOf(2);\n                const card = cards[frontIndex];\n\n                gsap.set(card, {\n                    x: deltaX,\n                    y: `calc(-5% + ${deltaY}px)`, // Keep it relative to its base vertical offset\n                    rotationZ: deltaX * 0.03,\n                    z: 80\n                });\n            });\n\n            document.addEventListener('pointerup', (e) => {\n                if (!isDragging) return;\n                isDragging = false;\n\n                const deltaX = e.clientX - startX;\n                const frontIndex = activeIndices.indexOf(2);\n                const card = cards[frontIndex];\n                card.style.cursor = 'grab';\n\n                if (Math.abs(deltaX) > 120) {\n                    // Swipe Threshold Met -> Fly away and cycle\n                    const swipeDir = deltaX > 0 ? 1 : -1;\n\n                    gsap.to(card, {\n                        x: swipeDir * window.innerWidth * 0.8,\n                        rotationZ: swipeDir * 20,\n                        opacity: 0,\n                        duration: 0.4,\n                        ease: \"power2.in\",\n                        onComplete: () => {\n                            const oldFront = activeIndices.indexOf(2);\n                            const oldBackLeft = activeIndices.indexOf(0);\n                            const oldBackRight = activeIndices.indexOf(1);\n\n                            // Cycle the layout logic\n                            activeIndices[oldFront] = 0;\n                            activeIndices[oldBackLeft] = 1;\n                            activeIndices[oldBackRight] = 2;\n\n                            applyStates(true, oldFront);\n                        }\n                    });\n                } else {\n                    // Swipe Threshold Not Met -> Snap back to front\n                    gsap.to(card, {\n                        x: \"0%\",\n                        y: \"-5%\",\n                        rotationZ: 0,\n                        z: 80,\n                        duration: 0.5,\n                        ease: \"elastic.out(1, 0.7)\"\n                    });\n                }\n            });\n\n            function applyStates(animate = true, fromOffscreenIndex = -1) {\n                cards.forEach((card, i) => {\n                    const stateIdx = activeIndices[i];\n                    const targetState = cardStates[stateIdx];\n\n                    // Extract properties to handle them properly\n                    const { zIndex, ...animProps } = targetState;\n\n                    // Apply z-index and cursor directly\n                    card.style.zIndex = zIndex;\n                    card.style.cursor = stateIdx === 2 ? 'grab' : 'default';\n\n                    if (i === fromOffscreenIndex) {\n                        // Enter the previously swiped card from the background\n                        gsap.set(card, {\n                            x: \"-50%\",\n                            y: animProps.y,\n                            z: animProps.z,\n                            rotationZ: -15,\n                            opacity: 0\n                        });\n                        gsap.to(card, {\n                            ...animProps,\n                            opacity: 1,\n                            duration: 0.6,\n                            ease: \"power3.out\"\n                        });\n                    } else {\n                        // Transition existing cards to their new depth positions\n                        if (animate) {\n                            gsap.to(card, {\n                                ...animProps,\n                                opacity: 1,\n                                duration: 0.6,\n                                ease: \"power3.out\"\n                            });\n                        } else {\n                            gsap.set(card, { ...animProps, opacity: 1 });\n                        }\n                    }\n                });\n            }\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "aether-nexus-core-matrix.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/aether-nexus-core-matrix.jpg", "source_name": "aether-nexus-core-matrix-DESIGN.md", "views": 81, "forks": 5, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-05-22T07:58:12.433844+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T02:13:39.379266+00:00"}